{"title": "Exoskeletal Endurance", "pageid": 28279, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Exoskeletal_Endurance", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Exoskeletal Endurance</b> is a passive feature that decreases the damage you take and retaliates against melee attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Reduce all incoming damage by <b>2</b>. When the wearer is struck by a melee attack, the attacker takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution modifier</a></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Garb\" title=\"Bonespike Garb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Garb\" title=\"Bonespike Garb\">Bonespike Garb</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1121/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9317/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2897/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754653/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.627      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   36.627      1 -total\n 30.12%   11.030      1 Template:DamageText\n 29.68%   10.871      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 26.70%    9.778      1 Template:Damage_type\n 25.77%    9.440      1 Template:Icon_link\n 25.39%    9.298     13 Template:Trim\n 24.80%    9.085      1 Template:Icon_text\n 22.86%    8.373     